Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: GamingTux <240287558+GamingTux@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: libgpiod3, i2c-tools
Replaces: argon-1v5-oled-legacy
Conflicts: argon-1v5-oled-legacy
Description: Argon ONE V5 OLED Legacy C-Daemon (Original Screens + 1s Live Refresh)
 Drop-in pure C replacement for the original Argon ONE V5 OLED Python scripts.
 Recreates all original Argon ONE V5 OLED screens (clock, cpu, storage, raid,
 ram, temp, ip, logo1v5), fonts, configuration files (/etc/argononeoled.conf),
 and GPIO4 hardware button functions, enhanced with flicker-free 1-second live
 value updates and near-zero CPU usage.
